Alongside housings and accessories we supply bearings, so a complete mounted assembly can be sourced from one place and arrive matched: housing, bearing, sleeve, nut and washer all correct for each other.

**Thrust bearings** from GEM carry load along the shaft axis rather than across it, which is what applications such as vertical shafts, gearboxes and heavily loaded screw drives require.

If you are unsure which bearing suits your housing and shaft arrangement, speak to us. Selecting the bearing and the accessories together is usually what avoids problems at fitting.
